---
title: "After 2.5 years of incredible post doctoral training across multiple divisions of PNNL and faculties acoss the nation, my post doctoral training at PNNL ended today!"
date: 2026-04-03
---

After 2.5 incredible years at PNNL, my postdoctoral appointment came to a close today. I'm grateful to my colleagues in the Atmospheric, Climate, and Earth Sciences Division and the Environmental Molecular Sciences Laboratory (EMSL) for the mentorship, the collaboration, and everything I learned alongside them. 
Several collaborative and first-author manuscripts are still underway, and I look forward to continuing to work with the remarkable people I met there.
